    - DEBUG / ALLOWED_HOSTS / Postgres credentials from environment; secure
      cookie + proxy-SSL flags applied automatically when DEBUG is off.
    - CACHES: Redis via REDIS_URL when set (shared across workers, required
      for cross-worker DAG cache invalidation), LocMemCache fallback for dev.
    - CORS allow-all restricted to DEBUG; production uses the whitelist.
    - Throttle rates: global user rate raised 20 -> 120/min (the SPA fires
      several calls per page load; 20/min 429s normal browsing), and new
      scoped rates for expensive endpoints.
    
    Endpoint protection:
    - ScopedRateThrottle on /code/run/ and /code/submit/ (judge0: 10/min —
      each request fans out to N paid Judge0 calls) and /code/next/
      (recommend: 30/min — can trigger LLM test-case generation).
    
    Elo integrity:
    - Re-solving an already-accepted problem no longer changes rating
      (repeats still update mastery/HLR — spaced repetition is legitimate,
      rating farming is not).
    - Removed the guaranteed +2 floor on accepted solutions; gains clamp to
      [0, 50] so the expected-score curve decides what trivial wins are worth.
    
    Outcome-based routing flywheel:
    - retrain_ai now trains on [avg_acc, var_acc, avg_elo, engine_flag] ->
      actual_result_correct instead of predicting its own past engine choice
      (a self-fulfilling loop with no ground truth). RandomForest rather
      than logistic regression because engine suitability is an interaction
      with student ability, which a linear model cannot express.
    - RoutingClassifier scores both engines with the outcome model and
      routes to the higher predicted success; legacy 3/771-feature .pkl
      models still load and behave as before.
    - gnn_engine: mastery_dict keyed by topic NAME to match graph nodes;
      keying by Topic objects made every lookup miss, so the GCN always saw
      cold-start features.
    
    Tests (29 total, all passing against Postgres):
    - Repeat-solve Elo guard; outcome classifier learns the ability-engine
      interaction end-to-end through predict_route; training refuses
      degenerate all-one-class data; build_outcome_dataset feature/label
      audit.

